 can Constitution Society for a powerful Wrongful Conviction Day exoneree 
 panel. The panel will feature guest speaker Kristine Bunch\, Director of 
 the Indiana Innocence Project\, alongside other featured exonerees as the
 y share their personal stories of navigating the criminal justice system 
 and the fight for exoneration and reform. Lunch will be provided!</p>
