 \, law\, and ethics are invited to attend! Each session features a unique
  learning experience with different case studies. Attendees earn a Micro-
 credential in Applied Healthcare Ethics at each session. Practicing profe
 ssionals also earn CEUs at each session. Panelists include:&#160\;Dr. Jod
 y Madeira  Dr. Joanna Watkins  Tammi Nelson  Carrie Wade  Ed Hinds  Jim W
 hitlatch  Dr. Angela Opsahl  Kristy Todd    Free to Attend. No RSVP Requi
 red. Arrive by 5:40 p.m. for a complimentary light meal before the event.
