 in the health sciences\, law\, and ethics are invited to attend! Each ses
 sion features a unique learning experience with different case studies. A
 ttendees earn a Micro-credential in Applied Healthcare Ethics at each ses
 sion. Practicing professionals also earn CEUs at each session. Panelists 
 include:&#160\;</p><ul><li>Dr. Jody Madeira  </li><li>Dr. Joanna Watkins 
