SUMMARY:MVP LSAT Bootcamp with Lawgic Prep
DESCRIPTION:The Maurer Vision Program is partnering with Lawgic Prep to h
 ost a free three-day LSAT Readiness Boot Camp on October 6\, 8 and 9\, fo
 llowed by a full timed mock LSAT on Saturday\, October 10\, and then a re
 view session to cover frequently missed diagnostic questions. Led by Lawg
 ic Prep co-founder Zach Goldberg (172 LSAT)\, the sessions cover the law 
 school application\, the foundational logic the test uses\, and select Lo
 gical Reasoning and Reading Comprehension question types\, with real LSAT
  questions worked live. No prior LSAT experience is needed\, and everyone
  who attends receives a discount on Lawgic Prep's services. Bring a lapto
 p and whatever you take notes with\, create a free account at lawgicprep.
 org before the first session\, and register at the link below.  This week
 \, we are building the last deck and session handouts. Register by noon o
 n October 5th.&#160\;
