BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
DTSTART:20261019T160000Z
DTEND:20261019T170000Z
LOCATION:LOWELL E. BAIER HALL/IU MAURER SCHOOL OF LAW
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
SUMMARY:Sit\, Stay\, Plan: Estate Planning for Pets
DESCRIPTION:Join the Real Estate and Estate Planning Association (REEPA) 
 and the Student Animal Legal Defense Fund (SALDF) on Monday\, October 19\
 , for a presentation by Lisa Adler ('04) exploring the fascinating inters
 ection of estate planning and animal law.  Once treated as property\, pet
 s now have evolving legal protections and estate-planning options. Pets m
 ay be family\, but what happens to them when their owners become incapaci
 tated or die? The answer is more complicated (and more legally interestin
 g) than you might think. Learn how attorneys can help clients plan for th
 eir pets' futures\, and explore the evolving laws and practical challenge
 s surrounding pets and estate planning.  Whether you're interested in est
 ate planning\, animal law\, or simply curious about an unexpected and fas
 cinating area of legal practice\, come join us! Lunch will be provided to
  those who RSVP by 5pm on October 18!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join the Real Estate and Estate Plannin
 g Association (REEPA) and the Student Animal Legal Defense Fund (SALDF) o
 n Monday\, October 19\, for a presentation by Lisa Adler ('04) exploring 
 the fascinating intersection of estate planning and animal law.<br /><br 
 />  Once treated as property\, pets now have evolving legal protections a
 nd estate-planning options. Pets may be family\, but what happens to them
  when their owners become incapacitated or die? The answer is more compli
 cated (and more legally interesting) than you might think. Learn how atto
 rneys can help clients plan for their pets' futures\, and explore the evo
 lving laws and practical challenges surrounding pets and estate planning.
 <br /><br />  Whether you're interested in estate planning\, animal law\,
  or simply curious about an unexpected and fascinating area of legal prac
 tice\, come join us! Lunch will be provided to those who RSVP by 5pm on O
 ctober 18!</p>
UID:20261019T160000Z-2410793@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20260908T124657Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2410793-sit-stay-plan-estate-plann
 ing-for-pets
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T163130Z
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2410793
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Elly Slevin&#160\;<br />\n  Event Organiz
 er<br />\n  Student Animal Legal Defense Fund (SALDF)&#160\;\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:Real Estate and Estate Planning Association|Student Anim
 al Legal Defense Fund
X-LIVEWHALE-RSVP:1
END:VEVENT
