SUMMARY:Law's Biggest Blind Spot: Guest Lecture with Dr. Faraz Harsini
DESCRIPTION:Join us to examine the most overlooked area of the law. Dr. F
 araz Harsini is a biomedical and food system scientist and human and anim
 al rights activist. He will be discussing his experience with animal righ
 ts and how it connects to free speech\, the environment\, human rights\, 
 and LGBTQ rights.  RSVP by October 22nd at 10am.&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us to examine the most overlooked 
 area of the law. Dr. Faraz Harsini is a biomedical and food system scient
 ist and human and animal rights activist. He will be discussing his exper
 ience with animal rights and how it connects to free speech\, the environ
 ment\, human rights\, and LGBTQ rights.</p><p>  RSVP by October 22nd at 1
 0am.&#160\;</p>
