DESCRIPTION:Admitted Student Day is exclusively for students admitted to 
 Indiana University Maurer School of Law for Fall 2027. The program includ
 es panels with law faculty and law students\, information about financial
  aid\, a supporter session\, lunch\, a tour and a reception with student 
 organizations.  For more information contact the Office of Admissions.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Admitted Student Day is exclusively for
  students admitted to Indiana University Maurer School of Law for Fall 20
 27. The program includes panels with law faculty and law students\, infor
 mation about financial aid\, a supporter session\, lunch\, a tour and a r
 eception with student organizations.</p><p>  For more information contact
  the Office of Admissions.</p>
